Home Value: $578, 680 Median Monthly Rent: $1,589 Median Household Income: $87,550 Photo by Jeff Heaton on Unsplash 8. Grand Junction, CO Population: 71, 386 Average Commute: 13 minutes Median Home Value: $382, 523 Median Monthly Rent: $999 Median Household Income: $69,268 Kerri Mac 9. Greeley, CO Population: 118,694 Average Commute: 18 minutes Median Home Value: $411, 406 Median Monthly Rent: $1,403 Median Household Income: $74,508 Photo by Nima Sarram on Unsplash 10. Castle Rock, CO Population: 81,911 Average Commute: 27 minutes Median Home Value: $632, 303 Median Monthly Rent: $1,864 Median Household Income: $148,314",
